<title>USA: Mobil Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Mobil Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRFAX, Va 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.06		    $1.83</p>
<p> Oper shr		    2.11		     1.83</p>
<p> Net			826,000		  736,000</p>
<p> Oper net		 844,000		  736,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 394,100		  394,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Mobil Corp.</p>
<p>The net earnings per common share calculation is based on income, less preferred stock dividend requirements, divided by the weighted average number of common shares outstanding.</p>
<p>First Call's 1997 Q1 estimate was $2.02 a share.</p>
